config BR2_PACKAGE_FIRMWARE_TROGDOR_MODEM_LTE
	bool "firmware-trogdor-modem-lte"
	help
	  Firmware for the modem of Qualcomm SC7180 (trogdor) Chromebooks
	  with LTE: mba.mbn and qdsp6sw.mbn under qcom/sc7180-trogdor/modem,
	  which the LTE SKUs' device trees name instead of modem-nolte. A
	  package of its own because its files share their names with the
	  non-LTE build's. ChromeOS's build, taken from Cadmium's firmware
	  collection.

	  https://github.com/CadmiumLinux/firmware
